WEBVTT

00:01.070 --> 00:05.900
<i>Ever since I was a child, I've always 
wanted to be an eminence in shadow.</i>

00:05.900 --> 00:10.540
<i>And I've always striven to be one,
 since I was reincarnated.</i>

00:10.930 --> 00:14.690
<i>That remains true for me in this world,</i>

00:15.390 --> 00:19.990
<i>even if someone else is 
trying to tell a story.</i>

00:20.850 --> 00:24.460
<i>I'll just keep trying to 
be an eminence in shadow.</i>

00:30.230 --> 00:37.850
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

01:51.560 --> 01:55.010
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

01:55.010 --> 01:58.430
CLASS 1

01:55.010 --> 02:00.610
#02: LURKING! EMINENCE

01:56.010 --> 01:58.430
Still, you know...

01:59.060 --> 02:00.110
Yeah.

02:02.010 --> 02:04.630
There's a lotta people
 here with the same names.

02:04.630 --> 02:05.970
True.

02:05.970 --> 02:07.590
Um, Alpha-sama...

02:07.590 --> 02:08.810
What is it?

02:08.810 --> 02:12.090
Oh, apologies. She meant me.

02:12.090 --> 02:13.730
Oh, I'm sorry.

02:13.730 --> 02:16.670
No, I'm sorry for making it so complicated.

02:17.380 --> 02:18.780
So, what is it, Beta?

02:18.780 --> 02:20.730
Did you call me?

02:22.570 --> 02:26.540
Lupusregina, you knew when you spoke up
 that she wasn't talking to you, yes?

02:26.760 --> 02:29.190
Nope! Didn't have a clue!

02:29.190 --> 02:32.810
My name's "Beta" too, so I thought 
she was talking about me.

02:32.810 --> 02:34.300
Right, Delta?

02:34.300 --> 02:35.540
Did you call me?

02:35.540 --> 02:36.970
In a manner of speaking!

02:36.970 --> 02:38.610
Sure did!

02:38.610 --> 02:40.910
So, what is it?

02:40.910 --> 02:46.720
Hey, don't show off how dumb 
you are too much, doggie.

02:46.720 --> 02:49.690
You just insulted dogs, did you?

02:50.190 --> 02:54.380
Does that mean you're also 
mocking a supreme being?

02:54.380 --> 02:56.590
I'm disappointed in you!

02:56.590 --> 02:58.230
I didn't mean it like that.

02:58.230 --> 03:01.170
No, that was the face of someone 
insulting someone else.

03:01.170 --> 03:04.280
Was it? Unforgivable!

03:04.280 --> 03:06.020
Okay, let's do it!

03:06.020 --> 03:08.350
Teach her a lesson!

03:09.010 --> 03:11.020
Stop doing things...

03:11.020 --> 03:13.720
...to make this even more complicated.

03:13.720 --> 03:15.140
It is hereby forbidden.

03:16.660 --> 03:20.100
It's strange, isn't it, Naofumi-sama?

03:20.100 --> 03:23.650
It's a fantasy trope.

03:24.890 --> 03:29.140
I mean... it is annoying, though.

03:29.140 --> 03:32.170
Why don't we give everyone nicknames?

03:32.170 --> 03:34.230
Then we won't get it wrong.

03:34.230 --> 03:35.690
Indeed.

03:35.690 --> 03:37.700
That's not a bad idea.

03:38.020 --> 03:43.180
Hey, all of you. Your names are too 
complicated, so come up with nicknames.

03:43.180 --> 03:44.350
Huh?

03:45.890 --> 03:47.300
What?

03:47.300 --> 03:52.030
Our names were granted to 
us by the Supreme Beings.

03:52.030 --> 03:56.530
It is not permitted to change them.

03:57.430 --> 04:01.270
And ours were a gift from Shadow-sama.

04:01.270 --> 04:06.610
None of the Seven Shadows would 
allow them to be changed.

04:08.540 --> 04:10.500
That's right, Master!

04:11.190 --> 04:16.990
You're the one who gave me the name 
"Filo," so it's very important to me!

04:17.620 --> 04:19.360
Yeah.

04:19.860 --> 04:22.180
Sorry, that was going too far.

04:22.180 --> 04:24.810
No, we overreacted as well.

04:24.810 --> 04:27.700
Unforgivable! Kill him!

04:27.700 --> 04:30.870
That's right! Kill him!

04:35.810 --> 04:37.790
Our deepest apologies.

04:38.170 --> 04:40.420
Oh, it's fine.

04:41.190 --> 04:43.730
Your entire body is slime?

04:43.730 --> 04:48.480
It's more like I'm a shoggoth, so I am a slime.

04:48.480 --> 04:50.790
The possibilities are unlimited!

04:51.140 --> 04:52.930
And you?

04:52.930 --> 04:54.440
I'm a bug!

04:54.440 --> 04:57.160
The terror is unlimited.

04:57.160 --> 05:01.730
<i>Wow, everyone in this world is crazy!</i>

05:01.730 --> 05:05.200
<i>I'm totally blending into the background.</i>

05:06.090 --> 05:10.090
These are the new visitors to this world?

05:10.090 --> 05:14.310
Correct. The ones in Class 1 are 
calling themselves the Seven Shadows,

05:14.310 --> 05:18.960
and saying they've been working in secret 
to advance their master's ambitions.

05:18.960 --> 05:23.480
But their boss isn't at the school, right?

05:23.480 --> 05:25.130
That's...

05:25.130 --> 05:29.180
Yeah, it doesn't make sense based on the 
rules we've seen about new students.

05:29.460 --> 05:30.230
Ainz.

05:30.230 --> 05:30.950
Hmm?

05:30.950 --> 05:32.430
What are your thoughts?

05:33.100 --> 05:35.250
<i>Don't just put me on the spot like that!</i>

05:35.250 --> 05:38.390
<i>Maybe we just haven't seen him,
 and he's around somewhere?</i>

05:38.390 --> 05:41.620
<i>No, that's way too obvious 
to be what she's asking.</i>

05:42.340 --> 05:43.860
Hm...

05:44.670 --> 05:47.370
So that's it, Ainz-sama!

05:47.370 --> 05:50.550
Yeah! That's uh... it.

05:50.550 --> 05:51.960
What's it?

05:51.960 --> 05:57.030
This "master" of theirs is attempting to 
manipulate the world from the shadows.

05:57.780 --> 06:02.010
Which means he's certainly here somewhere.

06:02.010 --> 06:04.040
So it's an exception to the rules, in a sense?

06:04.040 --> 06:06.630
But if that exception gets pushed too far...

06:06.630 --> 06:11.790
He's probably at school every day,
 attending normally,

06:11.790 --> 06:14.250
and yet we just haven't noticed him.

06:14.660 --> 06:17.660
Perhaps that's the reason?

06:18.010 --> 06:19.450
I suppose.

06:19.450 --> 06:21.310
But is that possible?

06:21.310 --> 06:26.150
I don't know. But in this world,
 it may be possible.

06:26.150 --> 06:27.580
That's a problem.

06:29.090 --> 06:32.190
But I'm sure there's little to fear.

06:33.790 --> 06:41.490
We have our very own supreme being, 
the ruler of the darkness, Ainz-sama!

06:41.830 --> 06:44.590
Hm, I don't know if we need to go that far.

06:44.590 --> 06:52.050
I think at this point, I've gone beyond 
just blending into the background.

06:52.430 --> 06:56.990
Anyway, that skeleton guy is 
the ruler of the darkness, huh?

06:59.310 --> 07:01.610
Yeah, that's super-cool!

07:02.600 --> 07:05.910
Anyway, it's clear we need 
to be on high alert,

07:05.910 --> 07:08.330
since we don't know if they're friend or foe.

07:08.330 --> 07:09.310
Yes.

07:09.310 --> 07:10.080
Indeed—

07:10.080 --> 07:10.810
Hey.

07:13.450 --> 07:17.610
Didn't a student we've never 
seen before just walk by?

07:19.590 --> 07:20.860
Huh?

07:20.860 --> 07:23.490
Did you guys not see him?

07:23.490 --> 07:24.260
No...

07:24.260 --> 07:25.510
Not at all.

07:26.100 --> 07:28.870
I... I saw him!

07:29.620 --> 07:31.770
As expected of a supreme being!

07:31.770 --> 07:33.010
Huh? Ainz?

07:33.010 --> 07:36.390
He was doing an excellent job of 
hiding his presence, but I...

07:36.390 --> 07:38.760
Yes, I noticed him!

07:38.760 --> 07:40.490
As expected of a supreme being!

07:40.490 --> 07:42.100
Ainz?

07:42.100 --> 07:43.560
Yes?

07:43.560 --> 07:45.360
Ainz?

07:45.360 --> 07:47.080
Yes?

07:47.080 --> 07:52.410
Explosion! Explosion! Explosion! 
Explosion! Explosion!

07:52.410 --> 07:55.430
Explosion! Explosion! Explosion!

07:55.430 --> 07:57.860
Megumin, you sure do love explosions.

07:57.860 --> 07:58.850
Of course!

07:58.850 --> 08:02.220
Explosion is life, and life is an explosion!

08:02.220 --> 08:04.830
I've heard something like that before.

08:04.830 --> 08:06.540
And yet...

08:07.690 --> 08:12.630
Rerugen-sensei keeps telling me
 not to cast explosions.

08:12.630 --> 08:17.590
Well, the school repair bills 
would add up if you cast it every day.

08:17.980 --> 08:19.480
It's not her fault.

08:19.480 --> 08:22.940
Megumin will die if she 
doesn't use explosion magic.

08:22.940 --> 08:24.230
Just like you, Subaru.

08:24.230 --> 08:27.930
Huh? You'll die if you don't use magic?

08:27.930 --> 08:31.660
Yup. He can't naturally 
expel mana from his body.

08:31.660 --> 08:33.800
That's pretty serious, isn't it?

08:33.800 --> 08:37.660
Is it? That's why he needs me, or...

08:37.660 --> 08:40.300
My mana builds up and then... boom!

08:40.300 --> 08:41.330
...I go!

08:41.330 --> 08:42.530
Indeed.

08:42.910 --> 08:45.690
Is that how his race works?

08:45.690 --> 08:47.850
Not quite, but...

08:47.850 --> 08:52.710
Anyway, Rerugen-sensei came up with 
a compromise for you to cast explosions.

08:52.710 --> 08:54.230
So just accept it.

08:54.590 --> 08:59.350
Yes. I'd prefer to fire them at a target, but...

09:00.810 --> 09:03.830
Okay, let's do it and wrap up for the day.

09:03.830 --> 09:05.810
Give us a big one!

09:05.810 --> 09:07.270
Leave it to me!

09:08.150 --> 09:10.150
Awaken, my soul!

09:11.060 --> 09:13.490
I guess it's time for us to go home.

09:13.490 --> 09:16.990
Yes. It's starting to get dark.

09:16.990 --> 09:20.140
Yeah, that means it's time for today's explosion.

09:17.890 --> 09:22.550
The void's thirst shall become 
the chains that bind us all.

09:19.300 --> 09:21.780
I really like this.

09:21.780 --> 09:23.930
They're called "fireworks," right?

09:22.550 --> 09:26.930
I am the voice that calls, the 
lamenting cry, no, destiny!

09:24.230 --> 09:26.850
Yes, they were a tradition in my homeland.

09:26.850 --> 09:30.380
Subaru, what was I supposed to say again?

09:26.930 --> 09:32.070
Hearer of my words, as long as
I am here, so is explosion magic.

09:30.380 --> 09:32.780
Aw, you know what to say.

09:32.410 --> 09:36.170
When I unleash my spell, explosion 
magic shall fly into the sky!

09:32.780 --> 09:35.170
I sure do. Okay, got it.

09:35.170 --> 09:37.310
Tamaya!

09:36.540 --> 09:40.470
Annihilate the void and manifest before me!

09:37.310 --> 09:39.660
Emilia-tan, it's not time yet!

09:40.470 --> 09:42.030
Say it after this!

09:42.030 --> 09:42.850
Blast!

09:43.620 --> 09:45.850
Explosion!

09:50.290 --> 09:53.070
Subaru, there's somewhere there!

09:53.070 --> 09:54.130
What?!

09:57.380 --> 10:01.990
The brightest light only 
makes the shadow stronger...

10:02.610 --> 10:06.350
I am...

10:09.500 --> 10:10.750
...atomic.

10:19.020 --> 10:20.790
Subaru, look!

10:21.610 --> 10:23.470
Is he okay?

10:23.890 --> 10:27.350
How dare he interrupt my explosion magic!

10:28.890 --> 10:32.980
Megumin... didn't do this on her own, right?
